@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 2: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/:orderId/revision-detail

actor "Supervisor / Auditor" as Auditor
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Revision Detail Service" as Service
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "session_items DB\n(transport_order_count_session_items)" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB
participant "products DB\n(products / Catalog)" as CatalogDB

Auditor -> Web: Selecciona una Orden de Transporte (ej: OT-100451)
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/supervisor/reports/transport-orders/100451/revision-detail
Gateway -> Service: getOrderRevisionDetail(orderId: 100451)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderHeaderWithTruckAndRoute(100451)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader (OT, Chofer, Camión, Ruta, Distribuidor)

Service -> SessionDB: 2. findCountSessionsByOrderId(100451)
SessionDB --> Service: countSessions[] (DRIVER_INITIAL, SUPERVISOR_DISCREPANCY, SUPERVISOR_SEMAPHORE)

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 3. findSessionItemsBySessionIds([101, 102, 103])
SessionItemsDB --> Service: sessionItems[] (Conteo, cajas, unidades, diferencias por sesión)

Service -> InvDB: 4. findOfficialTruckInventories(100451)
InvDB --> Service: truckInventories[] (loaded_qty, variance_qty, status, supervisor_id)

Service -> CatalogDB: 5. findProductsCatalog(productIds)
CatalogDB --> Service: productsCatalog[] (SKU, descripción, categoría, cadena de frío)

Service -> Service: 6. buildMultiSessionComparisonMatrix(orderHeader, countSessions, sessionItems, truckInventories, catalog)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Timeline de 4 Hitos: Conteo Chofer -> Revisión Sup -> Auditoría Semáforo -> Oficial
  - Matriz Comparativa: Esperado vs Chofer vs Supervisor vs Semáforo vs Final
  - Balance de Carga y Firmas Digitales SVG
end note

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (OrderRevisionDetailResponse)
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK JSON
Web --> Auditor: Renderiza Línea de Tiempo de Sesiones y Matriz Comparativa
@enduml
